## CI/CD

GitHub Actions is used for automated testing.

Workflow location:

```text
.github/
└── workflows/
    └── ci.yml
```

The CI pipeline installs the project development dependencies and runs the automated test suite.

```text
Git Push / Pull Request
        ↓
GitHub Actions
        ↓
Python Setup
        ↓
Install Dependencies
        ↓
Run Tests
        ↓
PASS / FAIL
```

